.SS Boxed table, aligned columns
The box option adds rules above and below; keys r and c align right and center.
.PP
.nf
\&.TS
box tab(@);
lb cb rb
l  c  r.
NAME@KIND@SIZE
_
alpha@file@12
beta@directory@3456
\&.TE
.fi
.PP
